{"count": 184, "results": [{"listing_id": 12174673, "rating": 5, "review": "its my favorite mug, cause size is perfect for me. This mug really good for warm coffee and for cold too. Every day this mug with me))", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1678924800, "source_review_id": "en_0819399"}, {"listing_id": 616879305, "rating": 2, "review": "With the lid off this mug only holds 16 OZ. With the lid on it holds much less. I contacted the company and they said I received the correct mug. They did refund my money, but this is NOT a 20 OZ. mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1678968000, "source_review_id": "en_0151047"}, {"listing_id": 1522962590, "rating": 3, "review": "The coffee maker mug looks great. However it has a crack in the lid where the steam stopper is which detracts from the quality of the mug. Kind of disappointed with this mug because of the crack.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679011200, "source_review_id": "en_0702198"}, {"listing_id": 24130088, "rating": 5, "review": "This's such a nice mug! I got the Charlie Brown one and once I saw it, I had to order another mug (Mickey Mouse - Red) :)", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679054400, "source_review_id": "en_0620100"}, {"listing_id": 516031820, "rating": 2, "review": "I have purchased this mug before and its a good mug, but was sorely disappointed when I received a dented product.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679097600, "source_review_id": "en_0358125"}, {"listing_id": 1820905547, "rating": 4, "review": "I liked the saying on it very much. It is a very nice mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679140800, "source_review_id": "en_0821658"}, {"listing_id": 3971166782, "rating": 4, "review": "My go to coffee mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679184000, "source_review_id": "en_0758226"}, {"listing_id": 2681875704, "rating": 1, "review": "This is definitely NOT the mug I ordered", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679227200, "source_review_id": "en_0350834"}, {"listing_id": 3389328209, "rating": 4, "review": "Tastes great, but I need to use two packets to make a mug of coffee, so that increases the cost per cup (mug).", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679270400, "source_review_id": "en_0995338"}, {"listing_id": 2428443301, "rating": 3, "review": "My dad really loved this mug but as soon as it was washed, the ink started streaking off. Pretty much a one time use mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679313600, "source_review_id": "en_0434833"}, {"listing_id": 2503578641, "rating": 3, "review": "I was willing to pay a little more to get a great quality travel mug. I will never know if the mug itself was a good value. The chip in the color (a thin film surrounding the mug?) upon arrival convinced me that it could never hold up to how I will treat it. Bummer.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679356800, "source_review_id": "en_0803219"}, {"listing_id": 4201695064, "rating": 3, "review": "Bought two ramblers from this dealer and the first one was great but the second one leaked from the top. I would expect a normal $10 mug to leak not a $35 mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679400000, "source_review_id": "en_0937376"}, {"listing_id": 2107398871, "rating": 2, "review": "I love Gilmore Girls & the mug is very cute & well made. It did, however, come with a warning notice inside that said the mug was made with a material known to cause birth defects and other health warnings. Very scary! Made me want to throw the mug away!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679443200, "source_review_id": "en_0657090"}, {"listing_id": 3381903624, "rating": 3, "review": "Too small for my coffee mug", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679486400, "source_review_id": "en_0563699"}, {"listing_id": 2567134002, "rating": 1, "review": "Received the wrong mug!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679529600, "source_review_id": "en_0487129"}, {"listing_id": 1903306874, "rating": 2, "review": "To many tea leaves in my mug...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679572800, "source_review_id": "en_0636315"}, {"listing_id": 4041397174, "rating": 2, "review": "Did not fit the mug I ordered to go with it", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679616000, "source_review_id": "en_0127985"}, {"listing_id": 1023451385, "rating": 3, "review": "I really like this mug! My Pastor liked it, too, until she poured her coffee into it and it cracked and dumped hot coffee on her! I returned it and will buy another one, to see if it was just that one mug that had a defect.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679659200, "source_review_id": "en_0257665"}, {"listing_id": 3211325055, "rating": 2, "review": "This is a coffee mug and it holds drinks. Within a week the battery had completely come off. Go ahead and buy it it you want a plain black mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679702400, "source_review_id": "en_0901264"}, {"listing_id": 30321252, "rating": 2, "review": "I washed this mug before I used it and when I when to use it for the first time this morning, the whole lip/top section of the mug broke away from the body and shattered on the floor.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679745600, "source_review_id": "en_0049640"}, {"listing_id": 2501214906, "rating": 1, "review": "This mug is not dishwasher safe. It says it's dishwasher safe but it definitely is not. After one time in the dishwasher, the printing was completely gone. I was left with a plain yellow mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679788800, "source_review_id": "en_0208044"}, {"listing_id": 2887304012, "rating": 2, "review": "This mug is absolutely adorable but the mug cracked as I poured hot water into it. This happened the first time I used it, so now I'm left with a Hello Kitty spoon.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679832000, "source_review_id": "en_0355871"}, {"listing_id": 170670968, "rating": 4, "review": "Cute mug, got it for my sister. She loved it", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679875200, "source_review_id": "en_0927440"}, {"listing_id": 153035311, "rating": 5, "review": "This is a great mug and diffuser set!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679918400, "source_review_id": "en_0399462"}, {"listing_id": 1368421328, "rating": 5, "review": "Excellent product. Best coffee mug ever had", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1679961600, "source_review_id": "en_0922581"}, {"listing_id": 3623704394, "rating": 4, "review": "If you love large mugs this is the mug for you", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680004800, "source_review_id": "en_0536878"}, {"listing_id": 638686063, "rating": 5, "review": "Good quality. Nice looking Mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680048000, "source_review_id": "en_0358784"}, {"listing_id": 3554016370, "rating": 1, "review": "They sent me the wrong mug and it came broken besides. I ordered a nana mug and received an aunt one. I get AWEFUL. It was my mother’s christmas gift I sent to her house in Texas.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680091200, "source_review_id": "en_0493707"}, {"listing_id": 2138978090, "rating": 2, "review": "I am disappointed not only because it is not made of stainless steel, the water tank has a crack, and the base which is for the mug is a little too small for a big mug. I would not recommend anyone to buy.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680134400, "source_review_id": "en_0350238"}, {"listing_id": 501146981, "rating": 2, "review": "Great travel mug - for 6 weeks. The plastic flip piece that seals the mug broke off already. Disappointed. I see other purchasers have had this same experience. There are better options out there if this is a known issue.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680177600, "source_review_id": "en_0767028"}, {"listing_id": 42424437, "rating": 1, "review": "This lid did not fit my mug, yet it was the lid recommended by Amazon upon checkout. The lid appears well made but DID NOT FIT my Tervis Mug. Not a happy camper.......", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680220800, "source_review_id": "en_0251677"}, {"listing_id": 1126049604, "rating": 2, "review": "Mug arrived broken returned never received a new one", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680264000, "source_review_id": "en_0686364"}, {"listing_id": 2248843972, "rating": 3, "review": "Like the mug, but the lettering kind of runs and smears.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680307200, "source_review_id": "en_0364014"}, {"listing_id": 2878229949, "rating": 4, "review": "Really cute mug. I would have given 5 stars if it were a bit bigger.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680350400, "source_review_id": "en_0983065"}, {"listing_id": 3756614456, "rating": 5, "review": "My husband thinks this is perfect size mug. His coffee machine makes a half carafe and it's perfectly two cups of coffee in this mug - something he has complained about with other mugs.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680393600, "source_review_id": "en_0687814"}, {"listing_id": 3465563655, "rating": 5, "review": "Best mug to get my boss for Boss's Day! It was appreciated and is frequently used. Mug is tough and durable and the graphics have yet to chip/scratch. It's a great product for its intended purpose!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680436800, "source_review_id": "en_0478411"}, {"listing_id": 3877428207, "rating": 5, "review": "Absolutely love this mug! My only wish is that it came in a bigger size. But I LOVE Jane Austen and this is the perfect mug for me. Plus the image on the mug is very nice, and I know it won't wear off like other mugs I've purchased. I also love Neurons Not Included. The description of the shop is hilarious and the products are definitely my kind of humor.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680480000, "source_review_id": "en_0189419"}, {"listing_id": 1939785570, "rating": 5, "review": "I initially purchased this mug as a gift. However, once it arrived, I decided to keep it for myself and purchase a second one for the gift. A pet peeve of mine is when a mug sweats. This mug does not sweat!!!! It also fits securly in my car's cup holder. I really like the color too. The stainless steel is accented with a smokey tint colored lid.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680523200, "source_review_id": "en_0025042"}, {"listing_id": 2416661125, "rating": 1, "review": "So upset right now. It’s been more than two months since since I order this stupid mug! I haven’t received my stupid mug. The worst is I can’t even track because the stupid company didn’t put a tracker on it! So wtf!!!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680566400, "source_review_id": "en_0474456"}, {"listing_id": 4211796297, "rating": 2, "review": "The writing on the mug in places was worn off and difficult to read!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680609600, "source_review_id": "en_0169342"}, {"listing_id": 1501353142, "rating": 1, "review": "Product came with just the cat mug... no soil or seeds.... very sad", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680652800, "source_review_id": "en_0141687"}, {"listing_id": 1022020866, "rating": 5, "review": "I mean its a mug with a saying on it. Thats what I wanted and thats what i got. Average size. Average material.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680696000, "source_review_id": "en_0704394"}, {"listing_id": 3637840372, "rating": 4, "review": "At first I thought this mug was not double walled because my previous mug (I broke) had a plug in the bottom. I was concerned about heat transfer, but it did come with a silicone protector. I've been using it for a few weeks now and I like its size and design.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680739200, "source_review_id": "en_0717883"}, {"listing_id": 1867973648, "rating": 5, "review": "Love this mug! I have a black mason jar mug. I really pleased with purchase of the second one. They style of this is cute and fun! This is absolutely lovely and I always enjoy drinking my tea. Good quality!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680782400, "source_review_id": "en_0165070"}, {"listing_id": 3870844970, "rating": 1, "review": "This Yeti mug was shipped without the use of any protective packaging, and when it finally arrived to my address, the mug had several dents and was damaged. The box used was too large for the product, so the mug bounced around during shipment and received several dents. I can't understand why bubble wrap, packing paper, etc. wasn't used to protect the product. Hopefully the replacement with be shipped with more thought.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680825600, "source_review_id": "en_0992794"}, {"listing_id": 612368076, "rating": 3, "review": "I was so excited to surprise my son with this funny mug. When I received the first item it was damaged, then exchanged for another. 2nd mug also arrived damaged. The way they packaged the item for shipping is to blame. For shipping the mug is wrapped in a thin layer of bubble wrap, in a thin box that has a cut out window and then placed in a mailing envelope. I have decided that I’m not going to purchase again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680868800, "source_review_id": "en_0120341"}, {"listing_id": 756981098, "rating": 4, "review": "Very strong material. Nice finishing. From top to bottom I use it daily both for coffee and beers. Already abandoned other mug. Doesn't keep cool that long without the lid, still, longer than other mug. If you're hesitating, get it, It's worthy.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680912000, "source_review_id": "en_0784027"}, {"listing_id": 331399060, "rating": 4, "review": "This is a great mug! It makes for a great gift! One thing to know is that it is supper small. You really can not drink out of this mug. It makes more a nice decoration to go around the house. I got this for my girlfriend as a little gift. I really wanted the one with the elephant, which I did not get. Take it from me, the order is completely random and you get whatever they ship to you. I did not read that part, overall it makes for a great gift, as a decoration around the house. I don't think you can drink from this mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680955200, "source_review_id": "en_0272678"}, {"listing_id": 1983606727, "rating": 1, "review": "Sent in the correct box but wrong mug! Embarrassing as it was a birthday gift!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1680998400, "source_review_id": "en_0103776"}, {"listing_id": 345655620, "rating": 2, "review": "Love the mug unfortunately arrived broken and without the gift card. But reordering", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681041600, "source_review_id": "en_0368069"}, {"listing_id": 4228210836, "rating": 5, "review": "These taste like just like thin mints and you don't even have to mug a Girl Scout to get them!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681084800, "source_review_id": "en_0652657"}, {"listing_id": 437143759, "rating": 5, "review": "A bit large mug for drinking lot of coffee/tea :D", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681128000, "source_review_id": "en_0379534"}, {"listing_id": 2522125978, "rating": 4, "review": "Fun mug...just be careful using scrub brushes over the glitter paint...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681171200, "source_review_id": "en_0686953"}, {"listing_id": 2214650354, "rating": 5, "review": "Very good. Now I just need to practice making a good mug of this Match. I would recommend this.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681214400, "source_review_id": "en_0086266"}, {"listing_id": 1569624374, "rating": 3, "review": "The size of this mug is a lot smaller than the one I purchased last year from the same seller.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681257600, "source_review_id": "en_0256996"}, {"listing_id": 2903059247, "rating": 4, "review": "It didn't come in the original packaging. It had a bag around it and that was it. Disappointed in the packaging when the picture shows it in Star Wars box around the mug. It's a gift for someone and I have to put it in a generic box to wrap. For $20 you'd think I could get the packaging that comes with it. Cool mug though.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681300800, "source_review_id": "en_0669936"}, {"listing_id": 385804364, "rating": 1, "review": "Item arrived in a damaged box; however, worse yet, the mug was cracked and then glued back together. The glue had literally dripped down the inside of the mug. This is just wrong! I must say though, Amazon's replacement/return process was easy.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681344000, "source_review_id": "en_0079034"}, {"listing_id": 873835319, "rating": 5, "review": "Really love this coffee mug, I wish they had more themed coffee cups with this level of detail", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681387200, "source_review_id": "en_0890735"}, {"listing_id": 1589191688, "rating": 4, "review": "Good day to day commuter coffee mug which does it job pretty well.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681430400, "source_review_id": "en_0813208"}, {"listing_id": 3430462041, "rating": 5, "review": "I'm a Nikon user and I love this mug! Everyone complaints on how cool it looks plus it holds my coffee!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681473600, "source_review_id": "en_0368696"}, {"listing_id": 2274207029, "rating": 5, "review": "This mug has been great. No leaks, easy to clean, keeps coffee hot for hours.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681516800, "source_review_id": "en_0745186"}, {"listing_id": 3484338863, "rating": 2, "review": "Hi, I wanted to let you know that one of my mug handle is broken and I don't want to send the other 3 back to get just one replace, what should I do,,Thank you", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681560000, "source_review_id": "en_0104213"}, {"listing_id": 1815224849, "rating": 4, "review": "Super cute mug just a little small tho! Great for milk and cookies 😊", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681603200, "source_review_id": "en_0077057"}, {"listing_id": 866303730, "rating": 2, "review": "out all 4 of them the inside mug kept it copper sheen one did not completely discolored like a gray copper.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681646400, "source_review_id": "en_0850523"}, {"listing_id": 3151089181, "rating": 1, "review": "This mug was sent with no protection and in a thin mailer. Horrible. Came instantly broken into pieces.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681689600, "source_review_id": "en_0011971"}, {"listing_id": 2422936703, "rating": 3, "review": "Yea as another said. Not for coffee because it's a 20 oz. Mug. Either pens or soup. Wish they had smaller size.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681732800, "source_review_id": "en_0569777"}, {"listing_id": 385107404, "rating": 1, "review": "Less than 6 weeks after the mug arrived, I had to return it. Hairline cracks formed on the inside and outside.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681776000, "source_review_id": "en_0314977"}, {"listing_id": 1082095470, "rating": 5, "review": "My Dad needed a coffee mug he could not spill/tip over easily. This does the trick!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681819200, "source_review_id": "en_0536548"}, {"listing_id": 95105171, "rating": 2, "review": "Right out of the packaging the words on the mug were rubbed off in places and the entire image was placed crooked... I'm disappointed because I love the humorous design! It was going to be a Christmas gift, but I am too embarrassed by the quality to give it. I wouldn't recommend this mug or buy from this company again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681862400, "source_review_id": "en_0490673"}, {"listing_id": 1686452352, "rating": 1, "review": "This mug looks super cute in the pictures. I ordered one as a Christmas gift and the product arrived in a few days. After the gift was opened she tried it out by hand washing and then filling with Hot Chocolate. Nothing happened. No change in color at all occurred. I filled out a return and then ordered a replacement mug. Shipping was quick. The 2nd mug also does not change color at all. I even held it under hot running water. This product is faulty.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681905600, "source_review_id": "en_0623096"}, {"listing_id": 524736115, "rating": 3, "review": "The 2 mugs are beautiful. I started using one right away. I store water in it over night like recommended and drink it the first thing in the morning. I've only had the mug a few days and there is a dark spot on the inside bottom that looks like the copper has flaked away. Also there are pits forming on the side of the mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681948800, "source_review_id": "en_0923546"}, {"listing_id": 2937151709, "rating": 5, "review": "The mug keeps liquid hot on its own very well. The heater plate works great. Gets liquid very very hot!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1681992000, "source_review_id": "en_0971119"}, {"listing_id": 3543717749, "rating": 5, "review": "This is the gift to give a very wealth in law that doesn’t need anything , but it’s their birthday so you have to get them something! Well he loved this mug! Thx", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682035200, "source_review_id": "en_0798718"}, {"listing_id": 1794402959, "rating": 5, "review": "The mug is cute as a gift, but wont get much use as we drink larger quantities than what this little fella holds.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682078400, "source_review_id": "en_0771850"}, {"listing_id": 2292708491, "rating": 2, "review": "Mug seems to be of nice quality and is easy on the eyes. That said it came without the spoon. There may be a few quality control issues here.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682121600, "source_review_id": "en_0792541"}, {"listing_id": 2947690254, "rating": 2, "review": "When I received my mug it was poorly packaged and the letters were chipped off. I was gonna gift it but I wouldn't do that to anyone.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682164800, "source_review_id": "en_0364863"}, {"listing_id": 214844400, "rating": 3, "review": "My Dad loves NCIS. Has to use a magnifying glass to read the tiny print on the mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682208000, "source_review_id": "en_0071660"}, {"listing_id": 843962112, "rating": 3, "review": "Down to Earth refunded me half-price (set of two) to cover the broken coffee mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682251200, "source_review_id": "en_0659590"}, {"listing_id": 2005768700, "rating": 2, "review": "This company stuck the contigo mug in the box and did not have any bubble wrap, just the mug inside the box. All the other companies I have bought products from have used bubble wrap to protect their products.. This company clearly does not care about what condition their products end up in when they reach their customers", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682294400, "source_review_id": "en_0796961"}, {"listing_id": 2947897021, "rating": 5, "review": "When I want just one more cup of joe, this fits the bill. Grind a few beans, put a #2 filter in, heat water on the stove and pour. The only tricky thing is to know how much water you actually need so it doesn't over run the mug. Pro tip, only heat one mug worth of water...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682337600, "source_review_id": "en_0256099"}, {"listing_id": 3580921948, "rating": 2, "review": "It’s pretty just ok for me. Size wise you get a mug full out of it. Not recommend for beer. I Don’t feel like it plunges down far enough. For one mug of coffee I shouldn’t have to put 10 scoops in to it to actually press the coffee. It works, but don’t waste your money. Buy a nice one if you intend on using it frequently.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682380800, "source_review_id": "en_0698673"}, {"listing_id": 4087978187, "rating": 5, "review": "Best travel mug I've found, and I've looked far and wide. You can't beat a vacuum for insulation.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682424000, "source_review_id": "en_0156040"}, {"listing_id": 3810190635, "rating": 5, "review": "Love it. Big oversized mug for lots of coffee. Very colorful. Received in perfect condition.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682467200, "source_review_id": "en_0773660"}, {"listing_id": 2342696282, "rating": 4, "review": "Nice design and size, but this mug is too heavy to hold with one hand. I found myself having to use two hands to be comfortable.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682510400, "source_review_id": "en_0380303"}, {"listing_id": 3292960388, "rating": 3, "review": "Cute concept, but the cat inside the mug is seriously off-center. Quality control dropped the ball on this one.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682553600, "source_review_id": "en_0992689"}, {"listing_id": 1272499103, "rating": 2, "review": "The mug looks very stylish and nice, but it leaks unless it is held perfectly upright and it's also pretty awkward to hold.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682596800, "source_review_id": "en_0655030"}, {"listing_id": 3949643339, "rating": 3, "review": "Hilarious white elephant gift, but definitely not a regular sized mug. Not sure about the quality. I just took a peak then wrapped it.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682640000, "source_review_id": "en_0194322"}, {"listing_id": 2163010511, "rating": 1, "review": "The Mugs are really heavy to hold and the handle of one of the mug already broke without dropping. Sorry am not a happy customer to recommend this.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682683200, "source_review_id": "en_0762021"}, {"listing_id": 2038333322, "rating": 3, "review": "It was just too large! If I were to drink a full mug of coffee in this thing, I'd be blotted and never get to sleep! So I gave it to Goodwill.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682726400, "source_review_id": "en_0580753"}, {"listing_id": 1784792749, "rating": 3, "review": "Lots of things to like, but the mug didn't work for me because the handle slips too easily for my situation. Can't fault anything else.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682769600, "source_review_id": "en_0765637"}, {"listing_id": 3718090639, "rating": 5, "review": "Nice quality glass mug, was a great Father’s Day gift! My son was really excited to give it to me.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682812800, "source_review_id": "en_0836796"}, {"listing_id": 997206042, "rating": 5, "review": "This thing is beautiful! And a larger mug then I thought. Gorgeous dark navy blue color. We love it", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682856000, "source_review_id": "en_0455095"}, {"listing_id": 735534788, "rating": 5, "review": "Been looking for copper mugs just could justify paying 10 a mug. Saw these and figured worth a shot! Glad I did, about to order another set.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682899200, "source_review_id": "en_0561257"}, {"listing_id": 1652594659, "rating": 1, "review": "This was a birthday gift and it came broken in pieces! I felt so bad about it I didn’t tell my daughter! Otherwise I think it would hav been a very cute mug!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682942400, "source_review_id": "en_0518923"}, {"listing_id": 2378684495, "rating": 3, "review": "Love the design of these mugs and capacity as well. So, I bought two and then two more. Only negative is I noticed cracking inside and out on one mug after a few days of use. Seems to be the result of impact or shock on the bottom of the mug which I feel happened during shipment. I'm sure my own handling did not cause this damage. Mugs have NEVER been dropped nor handled roughly. The mugs I received were packed two to a box with only a thin wrap of styrofoam around each mug but nothing protecting the mug's top and bottom... only the cardboard material of the shipping container. As such, exposure to shock/breakage is maximized in these areas and exactly where the damage I noticed occurred. But I did not closely inspect the mugs upon unpacking. Only after use did I see any damage. So, inspect YOUR mugs thoroughly upon delivery as some mugs, like the one I received, will not survive the rigors of shipment intact.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1682985600, "source_review_id": "en_0692324"}, {"listing_id": 894454889, "rating": 1, "review": "First of all, this mug is wayyy over priced. When trying to return item, not opened and unused, they are charging me an additional $12 just for UPS to pick it up. UPS comes to my building every day. This is the first time I've ever had an issue with returning an item and to be charged so much at that. I found this same mug at Target for $9. Bogus company with ridiculous prices. I will never buy from them on amazon again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683028800, "source_review_id": "en_0635148"}, {"listing_id": 602386561, "rating": 4, "review": "This mug is a present for my son-in-law. I bought one previously for my daughter and he used it with a great compliment that he wanted one also. I will oblige him one for his birthday.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683072000, "source_review_id": "en_0227648"}, {"listing_id": 2376835813, "rating": 1, "review": "Part of the front of the mug was all blurred out including part of his face. Bad print job I guess. But what can you expect really...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683115200, "source_review_id": "en_0457731"}, {"listing_id": 855764196, "rating": 2, "review": "I bought two of these mugs, and idk why this black mug sounds like it has sand inside it. The other one, a golden one, is just perfect it also comes in a travel bag", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683158400, "source_review_id": "en_0710864"}, {"listing_id": 3719417445, "rating": 2, "review": "I purchased this as a gift, and after only a month of use the lid broke and I had to buy another coffee mug. Not the quality you would expect from Contigo. Will not purchase again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683201600, "source_review_id": "en_0971717"}, {"listing_id": 3734365416, "rating": 2, "review": "My boyfriend absolutely loved it unfortunately the mug cracked along the edges as soon as he poured a beverage into it (which was water). Would love for this issue to be solved.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683244800, "source_review_id": "en_0113277"}, {"listing_id": 2627908250, "rating": 2, "review": "Was disappointed in this mug. Had ordered for a friend that's a huge Beauty and the Beast fan. In person, I wasn't very impressed with the design AND the rose was VERY plastic looking. I had also ordered the lid that was supposed to \"match\" but it really didn't blend very well with it. Since this was for a gift, I ended up returning it -- just wasn't pleased... I have a Tervis mug that I love -- and most I've seen are very pretty/cute -- but NOT this one!!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683288000, "source_review_id": "en_0785094"}, {"listing_id": 1228944252, "rating": 1, "review": "The top broke within a few months. This happened to both of our mugs. Stay away...not well made. Replacement tops cost almost as much as buying a new mug. Go to costco instead.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683331200, "source_review_id": "en_0959019"}, {"listing_id": 3553086093, "rating": 2, "review": "over a month waiting on shipping from China(?)and one of 2 ordered was cracked, don't know where I can't see the crack but as I hand washed for first use the mug filled with water.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683374400, "source_review_id": "en_0437939"}, {"listing_id": 705952186, "rating": 2, "review": "I have had the mug 3 1/2 months and have enjoyed using it. But now the interior coating is peeling at the base. I have been very careful not to use any hard objects in it and just wipe it out with a cloth. Disappointing.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683417600, "source_review_id": "en_0450110"}, {"listing_id": 321882223, "rating": 1, "review": "They sent a random mug. It was a gift and this made it a weird gift and now my 70 year old mother is supposed to figure out how to return it ... I’m going to end up paying twice for sure", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683460800, "source_review_id": "en_0329115"}, {"listing_id": 700570291, "rating": 2, "review": "I was super excited for this product to arrive. Now, it’s worse then a regular mug! The coffee somehow gets cold really quick and it’s heavy. I love the way it looks! But, would never purchase again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683504000, "source_review_id": "en_0973662"}, {"listing_id": 1704230911, "rating": 1, "review": "Product it really pretty but it arrived cracked because whoever packed it didn't realize this mug was made out of glass. Maybe he thought it was made out of diamond or 18k gold. It happens.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683547200, "source_review_id": "en_0196634"}, {"listing_id": 269744614, "rating": 3, "review": "You see it and it's beautiful. If you want it for decoration, I recommend it. If you want to use it as a cup/mug, is very large and not comfortable, the inside part gets out, the outside is fragile. Beautiful and expensive, don't want to destroy it....", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683590400, "source_review_id": "en_0533852"}, {"listing_id": 1787315019, "rating": 1, "review": "NOT DISHWASHER SAFE. The pictures are a simple, paper label plastered onto the cup. The first time it goes into the dishwasher, is the last time you will EVER have this Star Trek Mug !!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683633600, "source_review_id": "en_0464077"}, {"listing_id": 2485804036, "rating": 5, "review": "This cup is nice that now I can drink tea without worry about eating tea leaves and this come with a lid to keep it hot longer .. I really enjoy using this tea Mug..", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683676800, "source_review_id": "en_0264805"}, {"listing_id": 2366374371, "rating": 5, "review": "I bought this for my boyfriend who loves anything Harley. I was pleasantly surprised at how heavy duty it felt. Considering the price, it was a great deal! He uses his mug everyday!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683720000, "source_review_id": "en_0359080"}, {"listing_id": 4050633538, "rating": 1, "review": "DO NOT ORDER this mug tree! Our original order arrived with multiple broken arms, so we ordered a replacement...which also arrived with broken arms!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683763200, "source_review_id": "en_0154614"}, {"listing_id": 3302218324, "rating": 1, "review": "Nice mug, the reason for the review it’s because when I open the package one of them was broken, if you buy something fragile they should put more protection or maybe a note in the box that says it’s fragile,", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683806400, "source_review_id": "en_0685546"}, {"listing_id": 1591003284, "rating": 3, "review": "The saying is priceless and the retiree coworker that I gave it to really liked it. The negative-its small for a coffee mug. Says its 11 oz, make sure that this size is big enough for you. From my perspective, it was small.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683849600, "source_review_id": "en_0492321"}, {"listing_id": 717414559, "rating": 3, "review": "We purchased this espresso machine because we can use the normal coffee mug instead of the tiny espresso cup like other models. It works fine but there is always a leak on the milk frothing wand. The water keeps dipping when we're making our espresso. Very annoying. I'm hesitating between keeping this item and returning it. We still need to find another model that can use normal coffee mug with this price point. So I might just bear with the leak...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683892800, "source_review_id": "en_0771088"}, {"listing_id": 2001799978, "rating": 5, "review": "Wonderful handmade beer mug! I bought it as a gift and it totally worth it. Made to last, looks great, solid and quite large. Got that authentic feeling to it. 5 stars", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683936000, "source_review_id": "en_0083326"}, {"listing_id": 2068044739, "rating": 4, "review": "It is what it is.. A glass coffee mug with a breaking bad tribute on the outside. People complained about the handle breaking off. Mine seems fine, but it's certainly not as sturdy as other coffee mugs we have.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1683979200, "source_review_id": "en_0605589"}, {"listing_id": 1640574686, "rating": 5, "review": "Love this mug! My son (with help from Daddy) picked this out for me for Mothers Day. The cup is smooth, big and looks very durable. Ill know for sure the first time i drop it haha.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684022400, "source_review_id": "en_0844919"}, {"listing_id": 1665799608, "rating": 1, "review": "I love this mug. Been using it for two and a half months. It gets 5 stars in every department except durability. Already the handle is coming loose. It's only a matter of time before it comes off completely. I'm so sad. And disappointed.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684065600, "source_review_id": "en_0506500"}, {"listing_id": 1114758193, "rating": 3, "review": "Due to the depth and width of this mug, I cannot put my hand down to give it a proper cleaning. Thus, after a few weeks there is that awful buildup of coffee staining. Would not purchase again.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684108800, "source_review_id": "en_0013966"}, {"listing_id": 2776046332, "rating": 2, "review": "It leaks! It fits the mug perfectly but the twist cover doesn’t seal over the mouth part so liquid drips right out. I was very disappointed and am sending it back", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684152000, "source_review_id": "en_0987822"}, {"listing_id": 145402777, "rating": 5, "review": "This is the first steel coffee mug I've bought that doesn't have that horrible metallic taste! Would highly recommend if you hate the taste of stainless steel like me!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684195200, "source_review_id": "en_0885671"}, {"listing_id": 2676938584, "rating": 3, "review": "When I first got this mug I was in LOVE. I loved that it came with a lid and how cute it was that you can see through it. However, it cracked at the handle after about 3 uses. There’s now some water in between the layers that I can’t get out. Luckily the crack is on the outside so I can still use it, it just looks gross when it’s empty because of that water sitting at the bottom.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684238400, "source_review_id": "en_0418941"}, {"listing_id": 3736828776, "rating": 5, "review": "Great little travel mug. It's attractive, nearly impossible to spill, and easy to clean. I went hiking in sub-freezing temperatures to see a frozen waterfall and it kept my tea hot for at least 4 hours.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684281600, "source_review_id": "en_0307832"}, {"listing_id": 2505018363, "rating": 5, "review": "A good quality, attractive mug that was a perfect gift! I purchased this as a gift for my mother who had recently finished radiation and chemotherapy for breast cancer and she loved it!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684324800, "source_review_id": "en_0954382"}, {"listing_id": 2209260403, "rating": 4, "review": "It looks pretty but the mug is hot after putting hot coffee. You cant hold it immediately, it has to sit till its cool enough for your hands to handle. Not my fav coffee cup to go", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684368000, "source_review_id": "en_0931560"}, {"listing_id": 1718620564, "rating": 4, "review": "Perfect for loose tea in larger mug. Metal mesh is really fine - I haven't had any loose tea fall thru. It is taller than traditional china mugs and the larger strainer was really not all that much larger than this size. Just put in the loose tea, set in your mug, pour boiling water into the strainer, wait 5 minutes and take out strainer for perfect tea. And be sure to get this one because it has the lid you can put the strainer into after use - makes for much less of a mess.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684411200, "source_review_id": "en_0428261"}, {"listing_id": 2719140883, "rating": 4, "review": "Love these little mugs. I was looking for a new coffee mug and picked it for the flip top lid because I find the other styles too hard to keep clean. This mug keeps drinks warm for hours! And seals really well too. We have four of these now because we like back ups when we inevitably leave one at work. I will say that one of the mugs had a sealing issue at first because the rubber insert was different from the others we received, but we ended up swapping it out for the rubber band on the straw lid top and it now works just fine to keep our coffee from spilling!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684454400, "source_review_id": "en_0222060"}, {"listing_id": 3041429529, "rating": 3, "review": "Cup is nice and light weight. But when i drank hibiscus tea out of it, it is now discolored and has a weird blue tinge...kind of a bummer since i just bought the mug a month ago.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684497600, "source_review_id": "en_0943360"}, {"listing_id": 864098489, "rating": 3, "review": "I bought this mug to draw all over and give as a gift. However, the final result is nothing like the picture advertised. It’s really FAINT. Very dull. Even after drying and baking. Other than that, The cup itself is durable and great quality.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684540800, "source_review_id": "en_0872431"}, {"listing_id": 1678675367, "rating": 5, "review": "Really like this bowl for my short mug English Bulldog. He can still get in the sides (not too narrow like other bowls) and it helps slow down his eating. Sturdy and the small size was plenty big did his portion.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684584000, "source_review_id": "en_0011444"}, {"listing_id": 4282652371, "rating": 5, "review": "Great product! A little tricky to get it set up, but wasn't a huge issue. Warmed up some water in a mug and placed it on top and worked great. Make sure you wipe it dry when finished. :)", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684627200, "source_review_id": "en_0406396"}, {"listing_id": 923860221, "rating": 4, "review": "These seal's not only work on my stainless steel hot/cold cup, but are an excellent fit for my husbands big bubba mug. Great quality and they stand up to what is advertised.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684670400, "source_review_id": "en_0784665"}, {"listing_id": 3662054296, "rating": 2, "review": "I like this travel mug for the fact that it doesn't leak. HOWEVER I have now bought 5 mugs because the lids keep breaking. The button/lock mechanism breaks. Or the attachment at the hinge that is supposed to make the lid bounce back breaks. None of these instances have been the result of dropping the mug. They just break at random. Very poor design for the lids. The Thermos water bottle which is fairly similar in design has never broken once. I've had those for years! Why can't you just use the same design????", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684713600, "source_review_id": "en_0095248"}, {"listing_id": 3638486091, "rating": 4, "review": "These are perfect, inexpensive blank canvas mugs to create any fun project. I used mine to make a gag-gift for a nurse I work with and it came out great. Since this mug is flat (equal circumference from top to bottom) and tall, it makes crafting quite simple, especially if you’re using a Cricut and applying permanent vinyl, which is what I used. The only thing I do not like about these mugs are their inelegant handles. They’re pretty large and make the mug less appealing. Overall for the price, they’re not a bag option!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684756800, "source_review_id": "en_0860176"}, {"listing_id": 2871300017, "rating": 3, "review": "Pay attention to measurements because the mugs are tiny. I couldn’t even put a normal sized mug in their place because most of my mugs are 2 tall to fit. Also only holds 10 oz total of water", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684800000, "source_review_id": "en_0193404"}, {"listing_id": 1421419534, "rating": 1, "review": "We couldn’t be more disappointed. We always used to purchase this coffee at Costco. The pod has new packaging which causes coffee grounds to fall out into the coffee mug and all over the Keurig. I wasted several pods because my Keurig kept saying it was not the correct pod.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684843200, "source_review_id": "en_0378439"}, {"listing_id": 139910304, "rating": 3, "review": "Had to return first one. There was no filter basket in it. Received the replacement today. The mug does not have the cap that goes on it. It remains to be seen how the coffee maker works. Black & Decker is a reliable product. The problem seems to be with the packaging department.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684886400, "source_review_id": "en_0773156"}, {"listing_id": 1499643397, "rating": 2, "review": "I was not impressed with this high protein treat. It was practically flavorless, and not cakey at all. I'm not expecting a regular mug cake made with flour and all, but this was like snacking on a spongy, flavorless foreign substance. Not worth it.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684929600, "source_review_id": "en_0513569"}, {"listing_id": 3107075859, "rating": 2, "review": "Love the color, shape, and size of this mug and it keeps my tea nice an warm while I'm at work....BUT the lid has developed a crack all the way through the middle with minimal use. I bought this in November so a bit disappointed to be having an issue with it already :-(", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1684972800, "source_review_id": "en_0915666"}, {"listing_id": 230729900, "rating": 4, "review": "Makes a tasty mug of hazelnut cappuccino when set on the 8 ounce setting. Adding a bit of real whipped creamed to the top makes it even tastier. Reasonably priced per cup/pod.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685016000, "source_review_id": "en_0787166"}, {"listing_id": 3093816095, "rating": 4, "review": "I bought these hoping to not burn my lips on hot stainless steel camp coffee mug - they work great - good fit on mug lip, stays where you put it, somewhat affordable, and makes camping a little more enjoyable The con is that after my purchase, I bought a titanium cup and, since titanium doesn't hold heat the way stainless does, the cup is not hot enough to need this item and I don't really use them anymore If you're thinking about a titanium cup purchase, you might wanna rethink buying this item", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685059200, "source_review_id": "en_0456383"}, {"listing_id": 3925939035, "rating": 1, "review": "Initially, I had an issue with the product where I couldn't get it to work at all. I determined the cause to be a necessary software update, which then wouldn't process due to an incompatibility with a new version of iOS. Two weeks later, I got my mug updated and got to use it. My first experience was putting coffee into the mug, lid closed. I kept the liquid under the \"Fill Line\" as instructed, and when my drink reached temperature and I went to open it to drink, the lid \"popped\" violently, and sprayed liquid everywhere. If you travel with this lid and use it in the closed position, expect to have to force the lid open and have liquid spray out in all directions. It's not a rare occurrence with regular use. The experience, upon using the mug, was nothing exceptional. It would keep drinks warm for about two hours, set to a specific temperature. But, unless it's plugged into its charging pad, I've found it will occasionally \"forget\" to keep the drink warm. I'll tap the logo, the mug will light up and inform me my drink has dropped twenty degrees from where I had it set, and it has to try to warm it up. Not quite the experience I expected, but it's not a major issue. Then, the lid broke. The lid is a ring in the center of the mug, and you have to depress it, where it latches and stays open to allow you to drink. My lid broke such that the lid would no longer latch into place, and would rock off to one side or the other, so that I could either get no liquid out at all, if the lid were centered, or I could get a sporadic and slow trickle of liquid out by getting the lid stuck inside itself. I contacted them and was summarily shipped a replacement lid, and I thought perhaps it would be a fluke. I got the lid, and continued as normal. In this time, the mug would often (probably 8 times out of 10) refuse to turn on without first being touched to the charger. Again, not a great experience for a $150 coffee mug. Then, just now, my second lid broke. I'm going to have to contact customer support again, and see if they'll ship me another lid. All this has occurred since September 2017, a five-month period. Not the level of quality I would presume to get from such an expensive luxury product, but I'll have to consider this a lesson learned. I had high hopes for this product, but it would seem the Kickstarter Curse is as present as ever. It has been a considerable waste of money, energy, and time, and I do not recommend anyone buy this product, or any other product from Ember.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685102400, "source_review_id": "en_0451943"}, {"listing_id": 2132622352, "rating": 3, "review": "I received the first mug broken so I asked to exchange it and luckily it was exchanged, I received the second one fine but after 4 days of using it, while I was washing it the handle just broke off. It was nice while it lasted, and kept my drink warm but it’s super fragile and broke on its own.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685145600, "source_review_id": "en_0790647"}, {"listing_id": 32342678, "rating": 3, "review": "I bought these for me Hawaiian Birthday Party to make shave ice. The only problem is they tip over very easily. This makes it impossible to fill with ice without holding them. I ended up putting them in a tall glass/mug to fill.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685188800, "source_review_id": "en_0542939"}, {"listing_id": 1847744580, "rating": 4, "review": "I bought this because I needed a long strap during winter. The short straps kept slipping off the shoulder of my coat. I pack everything in my work bag including my lunch and travel mug. It's narrow and tall instead of wider at the base.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685232000, "source_review_id": "en_0793732"}, {"listing_id": 4228018218, "rating": 2, "review": "While I'm sure the cup is great do not buy from this seller. When I ordered a new cup I received an unwrapped mug ( i know because ordered 1 from another seller and that was wrapped) . It had a retrun label stuck to it that then has to be scraped off. Shame on this company for selling a used product advertised as new", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685275200, "source_review_id": "en_0162528"}, {"listing_id": 591912455, "rating": 2, "review": "I am a Contigo fan, but they do not make a 32 oz. mug so I decided to try this Pelican. I was leary about the plastic lid, as I wasn't sure if it would keep the contents as warm or be leakproof. It is neither!!! It doesn't keep coffee as warm for as many hours as it says. For me, I've found maybe stays hot for 2 hrs. at most, then just starts cooling off. Also if you accidentally even tip this cup, contents leak out even when it is closed. Does not hold up to Contigo where I could drop a full cup on the floor and nothing leaks. I can also shake a Contigo cup (if I'm mixing a drink, etc.) and they will not leak. I have about 4 Contigos and they've all performed the same. VERY DISAPPOINTED in this mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685318400, "source_review_id": "en_0831707"}, {"listing_id": 556608252, "rating": 4, "review": "Not much to say about this other than it serves its purpose very well, Keeps my cold beverages cold for a good time. The difficulty arises with the lid that I would have bought it with. Very hard to clean and the replacement lid is almost the cost of a new mug. Had a few spills with it as well because the lid can't be locked but otherwise its a good purchase.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685361600, "source_review_id": "en_0481575"}, {"listing_id": 1701900089, "rating": 1, "review": "The concept for this product is fantastic, however, the quality of the item is unacceptable. After using only a few times, the bottom part of the handle that connects to the mug cracked on the inside. I am not certain whether this was due to temperature or the weight, but the cheap plastic could not hold up to every day wear.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685404800, "source_review_id": "en_0954767"}, {"listing_id": 3326656335, "rating": 2, "review": "The mug is too heavy to carry around. It gets really hot to the touch, which makes me wonder how it possibly could keep coffee hot inside. Also, it has a vacuum problem. When you try to drink through the lid, the coffee just dribbles out, making it really difficult to drink. It's cute, though. I'll give you that.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685448000, "source_review_id": "en_0595723"}, {"listing_id": 1259479087, "rating": 5, "review": "Love this little thing. I use it in my car where the USB is right next to and at the bottom of my big cup holder in the center console. Now I can listen to 1000's of songs without fear of banging it with my mug. Rocketek has great customer service too. Email responses by the next day.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685491200, "source_review_id": "en_0212031"}, {"listing_id": 1547450244, "rating": 5, "review": "A bit expensive for a coffee mug but if you've got a friends fan in your life it's a good gift. Smaller than the mugs they drink out of on the show but the ones the cast drinks out of on the show are generic coffee mugs without logos so it's fine.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685534400, "source_review_id": "en_0239511"}, {"listing_id": 3117555855, "rating": 5, "review": "I have the 40 oz size, which is the size of a large industrial thermos. It's too wide to for on a standard cup holder in a vehicle, so be aware of that. I usually leave it behind in the car on walks/runs/hikes, so I have nice cold water on my return. It's easy to get a brush in there, food cuz I usually drink lemon water, so it needs regular scrubbing. The screw off drink sport is just right for drinking without pilling the contents all over yourself. Overall, it's well made and strong. And the Bubba company is fantastic. When I requested to buy a new lid for my old Bubba coffee mug, they sent me a whole new mug. Bubba has a customer for life!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685577600, "source_review_id": "en_0729682"}, {"listing_id": 2381958078, "rating": 3, "review": "I had carefully read the dimensions and thought I could fit a standard size coffee mug in it nicely. I was wrong. I did it but it doesn't look very nice. The large is too big for small plates of cookies and the small is not workable at all. I couldn't find any mediums.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685620800, "source_review_id": "en_0895153"}, {"listing_id": 1205164970, "rating": 3, "review": "I enjoy the coffee when the pods work right. The problem is that five to eight percent of the pods are defective and I end up with a lot of coffee grounds in the mug, also the coffee maker has to be cleaned of the grounds that are scattered all over. It doesn't help that the pod on the advertisement shows a defective pod.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685664000, "source_review_id": "en_0261778"}, {"listing_id": 2702268000, "rating": 4, "review": "Good quality mug. I ordered two at different times. Both came wrapped in thin cheap bubble wrap and thrown in a box with other items. One made it to me safely, the other did not. I had to exchange the broken one, but it was at no cost to me. If you are ordering it at the last minute, have a backup in case it arrives broken.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685707200, "source_review_id": "en_0772725"}, {"listing_id": 402145113, "rating": 4, "review": "I'm currently 28 weeks pregnant with my first child, and just started drinking this earlier this week. I am, by no means, a tea connoisseur. I'm extremely picky about what I eat and drink, so I was hesitant because I've always had to add in sugar or cream to my tea. Surprisingly, and excitingly, this has a gentle flavor, doesnt leave an aftertaste (yay!), and doesnt need anything added. I've been letting it steep in a large mug or 16 oz travel mug for 5-10 min instead of brewing 2 different cups. Hoping it helps with labor,since it's so expensive. But at the very least, its keeping me warm sipping on this during winter time without adding additional sugars to the diet.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685750400, "source_review_id": "en_0586861"}, {"listing_id": 1381893509, "rating": 2, "review": "This thing is TINY. Which is great if you have limited space as I do. The plastic is sturdy and it works perfectly with the pods I have as well as with the Chulux basket/filter I also bought to use with fresh grounds. I would give it 5 stars except I wish it were a little taller so that a lager size travel mug would fit. I had to purchase a smaller, 14oz travel mug and it will not fit unless I remove the spill catch and then only barely! Otherwise the quality seems excellent! Also... the orange color is not like the pics. It is a bright pumpkin orange. UPDATE: stopped working April 20. Won’t pump the water anymore. I’m very sad. It worked great while it worked.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685793600, "source_review_id": "en_0631496"}, {"listing_id": 288516581, "rating": 5, "review": "I use this every day to bring coffee to work. It keeps my coffee hot for hours! I’ve had cold beverages in the yeti and I believe this is it’s number area of expertise. The hot beverages do just fine, but I should be using a different lid for safety purposes. They’re cheap and easy enough to order though! I recommend this to anyone who is looking for a mug.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685836800, "source_review_id": "en_0112917"}, {"listing_id": 1263131684, "rating": 3, "review": "Its a cute mug - i love collecting mugs. this one bugs me tho because it doesnt keep things very hot and then i can't microwave it either because of the metal. So that part blows.... and i havent even had it a month and the handle seems loose. so i guess we'll see where that goes. But i dont hate it - its pretty to carry and use at work.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685880000, "source_review_id": "en_0087317"}, {"listing_id": 487257550, "rating": 4, "review": "Looks-wise this tumbler is awesome. But I should've listened to the reviews of the larger capacity version of this mug that mentioned the terrible plastic taste. Yes, the cap has a foul taste that taints your coffee when you take a drink. It's so disappointing. The mug is almost otherwise perfect. The other selling point was the easy to clean claim. Well, for the most part, yes. There are some small parts in the cap that are not so easy to clean - some silicone pieces inside that function with the trigger. I will have no idea if mold grows because those small silicone pieces are black. With diligent washing I hope to avoid mold-growth. Or perhaps I'll just not drink from the cap at all given the foul taste.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685923200, "source_review_id": "en_0145744"}, {"listing_id": 3963902351, "rating": 5, "review": "This cup has a surprisingly big volume for lots of coffee. With the lid on, it keeps the coffee hot all morning long. No more microwaving cold coffee. Also, the handle is high enough that the mug comfortably fits in a car cup holder. I haven't used it for camping, but I use it at work every day.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1685966400, "source_review_id": "en_0714187"}, {"listing_id": 3212739498, "rating": 4, "review": "I've owned other hydro flask products and love their proprietary coating but this mug is misleading and comes in a sort of rubber sheath around the metal cup. I wouldn't complain except you can pull the rubber away from the cup near the handle bringing doubts of long term life to this product.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686009600, "source_review_id": "en_0005129"}, {"listing_id": 2278669465, "rating": 4, "review": "The seller was very gracious and replaced my mug when my first one arrived damaged... Also sent me multiple pictures of other mugs to choose from, as I was dissatisfied with the color of my first. It's definitely natural ox horn material, so all of them turn out totally differently; just something to be aware of if you're expecting a particular color or pattern. But this shop owner will take very good care of you if you need it replaced.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686052800, "source_review_id": "en_0672899"}, {"listing_id": 2247588135, "rating": 3, "review": "These are mighty tasty and having dry packs around as an option is handy. Yet understand that 150ml isn't very much liquid. You will need to use two packs in a large coffee mug to feel satisfied. That means there are 10 servings in the box. Given the price point, I'd prefer to buy a canned product. I can only recommend if cost is no object to you.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686096000, "source_review_id": "en_0812719"}, {"listing_id": 248198919, "rating": 3, "review": "My main issue is the mixability of this product. It's so clumpy and doesn't dissolve easily. I have to stir and crush the clumps against my mug, and stir and stir some more. The fact that I'm having to consider purchasing some sort of gadget to blend it is not good. I don't want to have to make my morning coffee in a blender. That's just me... Otherwise, there's no after taste and seems to do the trick once you get the clumps dissolved.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686139200, "source_review_id": "en_0240383"}, {"listing_id": 536820382, "rating": 3, "review": "These coasters definitely have the look. We got them to complement our Friendsgiving table, and they certainly fit the theme. However, one of the apparent uses, as suggested by the product photos, is as a coaster for hot beverages. Placing a mug of hot coffee on top of a coaster caused it to split. Additionally, the attractive bark around the circumference is very fragile and breaks off easily. Recommended use: decorative.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686182400, "source_review_id": "en_0274799"}, {"listing_id": 3016823793, "rating": 3, "review": "Cheezits iz Cheezits. About all that can said on that front. A casual search turned these up as the least expensive way to acquire an otherwise commodity product. I bought these as a test of buying food on Amazon, and I don't think they're quite ready for primetime. The best box was about 50% crumbs, and the worst was closer to 80-85% crumbs. I ate them by pouring the crumbs into a coffee mug because that was about the cleanest way to get them from the bag to my mouth.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686225600, "source_review_id": "en_0946616"}, {"listing_id": 1432416147, "rating": 5, "review": "Well packed. Arrived in a nice box suitable for gifting. Look great in my home coffee bar. Unfortunate that people are leaving negative reviews on this product based on the size which is clearly listed in the description. If you are looking for a regular sized coffee mug, this is not what you are after. These are small espresso cups. Don't down vote a product because you ordered it without understanding what you were ordering.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686268800, "source_review_id": "en_0792443"}, {"listing_id": 4169342203, "rating": 4, "review": "I ordered this for my daughter who is now student teaching and graduating to be a HS band director soon!! It's very nice, but the top leaks, and it's not a top that feels like it's on as secure as one would like for a travel mug... I wouldn't count on it for fool proof travel, especially if you have clothes on for work, I hate to say... I wouldn't buy it again, simply because I got it for her so she could have it to take her morning tea in with her and she can't because it's nothing I'd risk wearing work clothes into for her band class...", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686312000, "source_review_id": "en_0983733"}, {"listing_id": 162986039, "rating": 4, "review": "I bought this bowl to use as a possible shaving soap mug and guess what. It works. The wood finish is nice. It's the perfect size to hold a standard shaving soap puck. Lightweight but seems well made. Wish it had a lid. The real test is whether the dish will hold up well given that I get it soaking wet every other day. Time will tell. In the mean time, I'm satisfied with this bowl considering it's reasonable price and the fact that it's handmade.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686355200, "source_review_id": "en_0327713"}, {"listing_id": 4265787685, "rating": 2, "review": "This looked like a great gift for my musician son but the writing on the mug is so small that it's barely readable unless you are very close to it. Also the nice box it arrived in reeked of patchouli and went straight into the garbage. Good thing I didn't need the box. The wooden cover is a nice touch and if the design on the front was bigger it would be quite nice. Not going to send it back as it was for an Easter basket but I would not recommend.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686398400, "source_review_id": "en_0232276"}, {"listing_id": 2939626328, "rating": 5, "review": "In the past, I've used my grandfather's vintage brass Gillette razor, and my father's butterfly razor from his army days, my own Merkur heavy-duty for the last 10 years, but on a whim, I decided to try this one. It's hands-down the best I've ever used. The silo mechanism works perfectly, the heft and size is just right, and (at least in my opinion) the closeness adjustment is perfect. Paired with good blades (I use Derby) and a quality glycerin soap (I use Mug) you can't go wrong.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686441600, "source_review_id": "en_0783032"}, {"listing_id": 2126210748, "rating": 3, "review": "I bought this mug about eight months ago, though have only used it a handful of times. I give it three because while it worked, it worked perfectly, is a great color and I like the larger size, grip area and that it fits in my car cup holder. But the last time I used it it leaked everywhere from the lid. I had it in the side pocket of my lunch bag. It was only half full, and I have only ever hand washed and air dried it. I’ve had fine experiences with other contigo mugs, but this one was rather disappointing.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686484800, "source_review_id": "en_0894448"}, {"listing_id": 1773751124, "rating": 2, "review": "These are made for adults. Its called girls in the title so I thought it would fit a child. It does say not suitable for children 3 and under, I assumed that was because of small pieces or something. I just purchased this as a cute little birthday gift for my daughter who is turning 6, they do not even come close to fitting her. They are actually even too big for me and my large 38 year old self... I could wear them but they would fall down. It's a shame, they are SO cute and SO soft but they are unfortunately not adjustable. Don't buy these for little kids. Picture attached with my 'tall' tea mug, just for size reference.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686528000, "source_review_id": "en_0131265"}, {"listing_id": 4229598178, "rating": 5, "review": "I LOVE dragonflies, and when I saw this travel mug, I knew that I had to get it! It's the perfect size, and easily fits in the cup-holder in the car. It keeps my coffee warm for about 2-3 hours which is great. It's not microwave safe, or dishwasher safe; but I'm fine with that. The colors are very vibrant, I get compliments on it every time I bring it to work with me. Another bonus is that it has a non-slip bottom, I'm prone to knocking over drinks on my desk, so the non-slip bottom helps to avoid that! Overall, I love this cup and will continue to use it as often as possible!", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686571200, "source_review_id": "en_0784688"}, {"listing_id": 1251347873, "rating": 4, "review": "4 stars because both reusable storage cases were broken. After washing them, I put them in a plastic freezer bag lying flat. They did take 2 days to freeze but now are freezing up within hours.I am using them in a lidded thermal mug for iced tea and they stay frozen and cold for hours. After use and washing, I put the unfrozen ones in a small freezer bag inside the larger freezer bag. One had a hole and leaked. Tested each as they were used and the other 39 are Fine. Much better than buying a bag of Ice for $2.00 every few days.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686614400, "source_review_id": "en_0228430"}, {"listing_id": 358002568, "rating": 4, "review": "This is an overall great buy if you are looking for a carry mug for your hot or cold beverages. The elegant stainless steel design is combined with an excellent build quality which feels premium and is very sturdy. My hot or iced coffee which I bring on the go stays at the right temperature easily for 4-5 hours, however I have also used other carry mugs which can offer insulation for up to 6-7 hours. Moreover, the narrow and tall design does provide a good grip but a textured grip would have been more effective to prevent any accidental drops.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686657600, "source_review_id": "en_0354025"}, {"listing_id": 1182591670, "rating": 3, "review": "This is a compromise between a 1 star and a 5 star. I purchased my first one in December. I instantly LOVED it for making Bullet Proof Coffee. Loved it so much that I ordered a second. My original mug (black) keeps on stirring like a champ. I took it to work and use it every morning. I clean by putting boiling hot water & a drop of soap and letting it stir the soap around. The I wipe down the inside & rim with a paper towel, rinse, and dry. It gets a 5 star review. My second mug (blue) I ordered in January. It is at home so only used on the weekends. It has been less than a champ and ended up being tossed in the garbage. Despite cleaning them the same (and my black one being cleaned way more frequently than the blue one) the blue one would always leave wet rings even after being hand dried. As I investigated the rubber bottom was not water tight and the chrome ring around the bottom was not attached. This means that when I dumped the contents of the cup, the liquid would run down the side, under the chrome, and into the battery/ motor compartment. I dried the compartment out, put new batteries in and it worked for about 1 day and then died. New batteries. Still dead. Flustered I tossed it. I think these are hit & miss. I will go back to using my frother at home on the weekends.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686700800, "source_review_id": "en_0186832"}, {"listing_id": 710782219, "rating": 5, "review": "I’m picky about purchasing great coffee and about the way I grind and brew it. I’ve be been looking for the perfect travel mug for years. This is the one for me! It’s easy to hold. Coffee stays HOT! It doesn’t drip or leek. I can throw it in my bag and not worry. My favorite thing is that the opening feels like you are drinking from a cup. Although the coffee is piping hot you pour a little onto the lip and sip it just like you would drink your hot brew from a cup. I will be getting one for my husband. It feels very sturdy. I just received this I need more than a few days use to rate durability. I will revisit.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686744000, "source_review_id": "en_0985407"}, {"listing_id": 317004118, "rating": 1, "review": "Loved this little machine. It replaced a Keurig - I hated the taste of the pod coffee. I love using freshly ground beans in the Ninja. The controls are simple and clearly labeled and the machine is easy to operate. The milk frother is easy to operate and clean. The large travel mug is useful for brewing two cups of coffee. The 4 oz setting with frothed milk is almost a real latte! The machine does not use a lot of counter space. And the price is very reasonable. However!!!! After less than 12 months of use, the water container cracked, the drip stop leaks, the clean light turns on weekly, and a significant amount of liquid remains in the filter after the machine beeps.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686787200, "source_review_id": "en_0196582"}, {"listing_id": 2933161763, "rating": 4, "review": "I am not an expert on chai. I am rating this tea solely on it's own merits and not in comparison to other types of chai. It smells wonderful with all the warm spices you expect. The bags are individually wrapped. The labels on the bags recommend a steeping time of 5 minutes. This made a smooth mug of tea. There was no bitterness. I added 1 teaspoon of unprocessed sugar. I tried it before adding milk. The taste of the tea was far less strong than the scent of the tea. Without milk, it made for a delicate and pleasant tea. I could have even let it steep another minute. For the tea to have a full-bodied flavor with milk in it, I had to leave the bag in as I drank it or steep 2 bags at once for 6 minutes. Of course, personal tastes determine how a person likes their tea, but this review may give you a general guideline. It tastes especially good with a couple of teaspoons of 'Hoosier Hill Farms' powdered coconut milk in it. It pairs beautifully with the warm spices.", "language": "en", "created_timestamp": 1686830400, "source_review_id": "en_0883517"}]}